# battle-arena

TypeScript. Play any driver against any driver at max strength ([ADR 0019](docs/decisions/0019-battle-arena.md), [ADR 0023](docs/decisions/0023-arena-any-driver.md)). Default is game-engine vs `gnubg` (GNU Backgammon).

- Loop: `docs/domain/battle-arena.md`, `ts-core/sim`. Every side plays its engine's own decisions (ADR 0032): its engine's top checker play and its own offer and take, each side asking its own engine. The arena never re-ranks plays or computes a cube decision; it only decides when the cube is asked (not on the opening roll, in the Crawford game, at cube 64, or with `--no-cube`). Alternate seats (`--a` is p1 on even matches).
- Drivers: `game-engine` (plays `POST /evaluate` `moves[0]`, cube from `POST /cube`), `game-engine-fast` (GPU engine, same `/evaluate` and `/cube` plus `?ply=N`, opt-in Compose service; `docs/domain/game-engine-fast.md`), `gnubg` (GNU Backgammon CLI sidecar, `docs/domain/gnubg.md`, [ADR 0031](docs/decisions/0031-gnubg-cli-sidecar.md); `teacher` is an old alias), `hedgehog` (external sidecar, `docs/domain/hedgehog.md`, [ADR 0030](docs/decisions/0030-hedgehog-plays-itself.md)), and `xg` (eXtreme Gammon 2 GUI sidecar on the host, `docs/domain/xg.md`, [ADR 0025](docs/decisions/0025-xg-gui-sidecar.md)). Do not vendor or port Hedgehog code, tables, or its `.ogxf` weights, do not touch the XG binary, memory, or settings, and never use either's output as training data (dumps, labels, distillation, tuning). gnubg is GPL: reach it only through its sidecar, never link or vendor it. The same driver may sit on both sides. `ply` is GnuBG, per side: gnubg 0–4 (default 2), hedgehog 0–1 (default 1), `game-engine-fast` 0–4 (default 0); above the driver maximum is an error, other drivers drop it and warn.
- SGF under gitignored `battle-arena/replays/`. No training JSONL. Open in `gui` or gnubg.
- Docker only, from `battle-arena/`. Host commands: [README.md](README.md). Do not run `battle:inner` / `test:inner` on the host. A game-engine side requires `training-ground/checkpoints/cubeless.onnx`.
